  "lyrics": [
    "[G]Sound the battle cry, [C]See! the [G]foe is nigh;",
    "[D]Raise [G]the [D]standard high [A7]For the [D]Lord;",
    "[G]Gird your armor on, [C]Stand firm, [G]every one,",
    "Rest your [Em]cause upon His [G]ho-[D7]ly [G]word.",
    "",
    "  [G]Rouse, then soldiers! [D7]rally round the [G]banner!",
    "  [B]Ready, [Em]steady, [A7]pass the word a-[D]long;",
    "  [G]Onward, forward, [D7]shout aloud ho-[G]sanna!",
    "  [G]Christ is [Em]Captain of the [G]might-[D7]y [G]throng.",
    "",
    "Strong to meet the foe,",
    "Marching on we go,",
    "While our cause we know",
    "Must prevail;",
    "Shield and banner bright,",
    "Gleaming in the light,",
    "Battling for the right,",
    "We ne'er can fail.",
    "",
    "O Thou God of all,",
    "Hear us when we call,",
    "Help us, one and all,",
    "By Thy grace;",
    "When the battle's done,",
    "And the victory won,",
    "May we wear the crown",
    "Before Thy face."
